{
  "uid": "cop-slo",
  "title": "COP / SLOs and error budgets",
  "description": "Objectives, 30-day SLIs, error budget left and burn rates. Rules: observability/prometheus/rules/slo.yml.",
  "tags": [
    "cop"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(slo:error_ratio:rate5m, environment)",
          "refId": "env"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(slo:error_ratio:rate5m, environment)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 18,
        "h": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Error budget** = 1 \u2212 objective: the share of events allowed to fail over 30 days. **Budget left** = 1 \u2212 (30-day error ratio \u00f7 budget). **Burn rate** = error ratio \u00f7 budget: 1\u00d7 spends the budget in exactly 30 days; 14.4\u00d7 over 1h *and* 5m pages (ErrorBudgetFastBurn), 6\u00d7 over 6h *and* 30m opens a ticket (ErrorBudgetSlowBurn).\n\n| SLO | Objective | Bad event |\n|---|---|---|\n| availability | 99.9% | an app request (ecommerce-api, incident-api) returned 5xx |\n| latency | 95% | an app request took longer than 500 ms |\n| freshness | 99% of the time | a moment when logs are not reaching Loki within 60 s (Alloy or Loki down, Alloy retrying, a push over 60 s) |"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Data in the 30-day window",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "clamp_max(time() - min(prometheus_tsdb_lowest_timestamp_seconds), 30 * 86400)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "value": null,
                "color": "orange"
              },
              {
                "value": 2592000,
                "color": "green"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "description": "Budgets are computed over the data Prometheus holds, up to 30 days."
    },
